# "mismatched asset hashes causing site crash" incident.

# NOTE (PDF hygiene follow-up): public/assets/*.pdf currently totals ~50 MB
# and is tracked as a *source* asset so `vite build` can copy it to dist/.
# Long-term, move these PDFs to Firebase Storage (or GitHub Releases) and
# serve/link from there, then uncomment the line below:
# public/assets/*.pdf
